## Original Content
The new CEO of Topgolf believes the brand has significant opportunities to grow revenue both within its entertainment venues and at outside retailers.

## Summary
Topgolf's new CEO plans to expand the company's revenue streams by increasing activities in retail media and licensing, areas where Topgolf has previously been inactive. The CEO believes there are significant opportunities for growth both within its entertainment venues and at outside retailers.

## Key Points
- Topgolf has not been very active in retail media and licensing.
- The new CEO aims to change this by exploring new revenue opportunities.
- Revenue growth opportunities exist within entertainment venues.
- Additional revenue growth can come from outside retailers.


